{"id":"n39351-1-7","stage":5,"title":"나날이 · 日渐","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n39351-1-7-1","ko":"유민 어머니는 못 본 사이에 더 젊어지신 것 같아요.","zh":"裕敏的妈妈，我们没见面的这段时间里似乎变得更年轻了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏","readings":[{"term":"유민","audio":"/audio/801e6fbf054693aba14c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민","audio":"/audio/801e6fbf054693aba14c.mp3"}},{"text":"어머니는","meaning":"妈，大妈","explanation":"어머니：妈，大妈；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"4","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니는","audio":"/audio/e9534e0c288558be0260.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"본","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"본","audio":"/audio/cf476351fc8f8f9d9a3f.mp3"}},{"text":"사이에","meaning":"间，之间，……的时候","explanation":"사이：间，之间，……的时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"2","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이에","audio":"/audio/088d82d3555d167bc296.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"젊어지신","meaning":"年轻，显年轻；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"젊다：年轻，显年轻；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"젊다","audio":"/audio/408a4bd77b296caac9e0.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75773","senseId":"3","lemma":"젊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"젊어지신","audio":"/audio/4e12e26b71b63aba07e0.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"妈，大妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于亲切地指称或称呼与自己母亲年龄相仿的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，见，见面","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"与别人相见。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"间，之间，……的时候","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"从某一时刻到另一个时刻的时间。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"408a4bd77b296caa","term":"젊다","zh":"年轻，显年轻","audio":"/audio/408a4bd77b296caac9e0.mp3","entryId":"75773","definition":"看起来好像比实际年龄小。","pronunciation":["점ː따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ccc4514e26bfc2b1c0c4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n39351-1-7-2","ko":"별말씀을요. 승규 어머니야말로 요즘 나날이 아름다워지시네요.","zh":"您太客气了。反而是承奎的妈妈，最近一天比一天漂亮呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"별말씀을요.","meaning":"特别的；话","explanation":"별：特别的；말씀：话；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。；요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"별","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3"},{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83164","senseId":"1","lemma":"별","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"1","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별말씀을요","audio":"/audio/43f9b20f2931e53c8161.mp3"}},{"text":"승규","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎","readings":[{"term":"승규","audio":"/audio/20c7bbd00a1a5f26d499.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규","audio":"/audio/20c7bbd00a1a5f26d499.mp3"}},{"text":"어머니야말로","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；야말로：特别强调：“才真是、正是”。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"2","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니야말로","audio":"/audio/8269c109b44996809b17.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"나날이","meaning":"日渐，日益","explanation":"나날이：日渐，日益","readings":[{"term":"나날이","audio":"/audio/b7451ad6ad85eed5975a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"39351","senseId":"1","lemma":"나날이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나날이","audio":"/audio/b7451ad6ad85eed5975a.mp3"}},{"text":"아름다워지시네요.","meaning":"美丽，漂亮；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"아름답다：美丽，漂亮；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아름다워지시네요","audio":"/audio/71a48274876f8249261c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ae3fc36d3a72017f","term":"별","zh":"特别的","audio":"/audio/ae3fc36d3a72017f758a.mp3","entryId":"83164","definition":"不同一般的，特殊或奇怪的。","pronunciation":["별"]},{"id":"9fa325aa12d3fdd0","term":"말씀","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3","entryId":"27365","definition":"(敬语)别人的言语。","pronunciation":["말ː씀"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"b7451ad6ad85eed5","term":"나날이","zh":"日渐，日益","audio":"/audio/b7451ad6ad85eed5975a.mp3","entryId":"39351","definition":"随着岁月的流逝，逐渐地。","pronunciation":["나나리"]},{"id":"b